        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Camilla Luddington, Catherine, Duchess of Cambridge, Jo Wilson, Stephanie Edwards, Prince William\n- Productions: Grey's Anatomy, Lifetime TV film\n- Organizations: ABC\n- Places: Seattle Grace Mercy West Hospital, Grey Sloan Memorial Hospital\n- Roles: Catherine Middleton, surgical intern, resident\n\nFacts:\n- Catherine, Duchess of Cambridge, whose birth name is Catherine Elizabeth \"Kate\" Middleton, was born on 9 January 1982.\n- Catherine, Duchess of Cambridge, is the wife of Prince William, Duke of Cambridge.\n- Camilla Luddington is known for playing Catherine Middleton in a Lifetime TV film.\n- Camilla Luddington is also known for playing Jo Wilson in the ABC medical drama Grey's Anatomy.\n- Stephanie Edwards was introduced as a surgical intern at the fictional Seattle Grace Mercy West Hospital, which was later renamed Grey Sloan Memorial Hospital.\n- Stephanie Edwards later advances to the resident level alongside her fellow intern and friend Jo Wilson, who is played by Camilla Luddington.",
